# Web3Forms — free, static-friendly form handler (https://web3forms.com)
# Register with hello@fonebazaar.ca, confirm the email, and grab the access key
# from the dashboard. The key is public by design — Web3Forms scopes it to
# a single destination inbox and handles its own rate-limiting + spam filters.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
